{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46127","headline":"避寇游成福山院 · 贯休","name":"避寇游成福山院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"成福僧留不拟归，猕猴菌嫩豆苗肌。\n那堪蚕月偏多雨，况复衢城未解围。\n翠拥槿篱泉乱入，云开花岛雉双飞。\n堪嗟大似悠悠者，祗向诗中话息机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}